#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Architected a serverless, multicloud self-service platform for building, "
"testing, scanning, and distributing 100+ golden machine images across "
"AWS, Azure, GCP, and OCI. Reduced release cycles from monthly to weekly "
"and cut infrastructure costs by 40%%."
msgstr ""
"Diseñé la arquitectura de una plataforma serverless multicloud de "
"autoservicio para construir, probar, escanear y distribuir más de 100 "
"golden machine images en AWS, Azure, GCP y OCI. Reduje los ciclos de "
"lanzamiento de mensuales a semanales y recorté los costos de "
"infraestructura en un 40%%."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:43
#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:66
