#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:60
#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:532
msgid "Image Factory AI Agent"
msgstr "Agente IA de Image Factory"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:63
msgid ""
"Built an AI agent powered by AWS Bedrock AgentCore with multimodal "
"capabilities — processing files and media via Gemini for RAG stored in "
"S3, then generating responses with Claude. Features custom tools, log "
"access, database queries, automated troubleshooting, and disaster "
"recovery monitoring with fully auditable, traceable actions."
msgstr ""
"Construí un agente de IA impulsado por AWS Bedrock AgentCore con "
"capacidades multimodales — procesando archivos y medios via Gemini para "
"RAG almacenado en S3, generando respuestas con Claude. Incluye "
"herramientas personalizadas, acceso a logs, consultas a base de datos, "
"troubleshooting automatizado y monitoreo de recuperación ante desastres "
"con acciones completamente auditables y trazables."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:82
#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:423
msgid "DNS Management Platform"
msgstr "Plataforma de Gestión DNS"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:85
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Designed the architecture for an enterprise DNS management application "
"handling 200+ domains and 30,000+ records with audit trail, ownership "
"integration, and failover planning. Built serverless on Azure with 100%% "
"IaC via Bicep."
msgstr ""
"Diseñé la arquitectura de una aplicación empresarial de gestión DNS que "
"administra más de 200 dominios y 30,000+ registros con auditoría, "
"integración de propiedad y planes de failover. Construida serverless en "
"Azure con 100%% de IaC mediante Bicep."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:105
msgid "Colegio Malinalli"
msgstr "Colegio Malinalli"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:108
msgid ""
"Designed and developed a responsive institutional website for Colegio "
"Malinalli, delivering a modern web presence to enhance enrollment and "
"community engagement."
msgstr ""
"Diseñé y desarrollé un sitio web institucional responsivo para el Colegio"
" Malinalli, ofreciendo una presencia web moderna para impulsar la "
"inscripción y el acercamiento con la comunidad."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:111
msgid "Click to visit the site"
msgstr "Haz clic para visitar el sitio"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:126
msgid "Crypto Trading Platform"
msgstr "Plataforma de Trading Crypto"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:129
msgid ""
"Built a collaborative crypto trading platform featuring a pooling system "
"where multiple\n"
"                        investors contribute capital managed by an "
"automated trading bot. The system handles proportional\n"
"                        profit distribution based on each user's stake. "
"Access restricted via private VPN."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollé una plataforma colaborativa de trading de criptomonedas con un"
" sistema de pooling donde múltiples\n"
"inversionistas aportan capital gestionado por un bot de trading "
"automatizado. El sistema distribuye\n"
"ganancias proporcionalmente según la participación de cada usuario. "
"Acceso restringido por VPN privada."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:146
msgid "Smart Terra"
msgstr "Smart Terra"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:149
msgid ""
"Co-developed a full-stack IoT application for automated terrarium climate"
" control, integrating real-time sensor data with a responsive dashboard "
"for remote monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Co-desarrollé una aplicación IoT full-stack para el control climático "
"automatizado de terrarios, integrando datos de sensores en tiempo real "
"con un panel de control responsivo para monitoreo remoto."

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:152
#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:251
