#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:288
msgid "Assistive Crawling Device"
msgstr "Dispositivo Asistivo para Gateo"

#: app/templates/includes/portfolio.html:291
msgid ""
"Co-designed and fabricated an assistive mobility device for children with"
" developmental\n"
"                        disabilities, combining mechatronic engineering "
